# Design system conventions

## Tokens, never hardcoded values

- The `ap-` system in `styles/tokens.css` is canonical: `--ap-neutral-0..1000` (theme-inverting ramp), `--ap-color-{background,foreground,border,action}-*`, `--ap-radius-*`, `--ap-space-*`, `--ap-font-{family,weight,size}-*`, `--ap-shadow-sm`. New code uses `--ap-*` only.
- Pre-v1.5 names (`--background-primary`, `--radius-sm`, `--bg`, ...) are transitional aliases onto ap- values — fine to leave in old CSS you're not touching, never introduce in new rules.
- Both themes must work: semantics are declared once as ramp references, so a raw hex is almost always wrong. Prefer `color-mix(in srgb, var(--token) N%, var(--other-token))` for variants.
- Type scale: 13px (`--ap-font-size-sm`) is the base; xs 11 / md 15 / lg 17 / xl 24. Bradford is `--ap-font-family-display`, UI text `--ap-font-family-sans`.

## Components

- Reuse the UI kit first: `Button` (primary/secondary/tertiary/danger), `IconButton`, `Badge`, `Modal`, `Menu`/`MenuHeader`/`MenuSection`/`MenuItem` (with `selected`/`trailing`), `Field`/`Input`/`TextArea`/`Select`, `Tooltip`, `Thumbnail`, `ShaderOrb`, `Icon` from `components/ui`. The agent composer is `components/composer/Composer` (shared by the zero-state home and the Create tab).
- `Field` renders a `<div>`, not `<label>` — label activation double-fires hidden file inputs. Don't "fix" it back.
- Icons: only names from the harvested set (`components/ui/Icon.tsx`, SVGs normalized to `currentColor`). New icons come from Figma, normalized the same way.
- Dialogs/dropdowns must close on Escape (`useEscapeKey`) and outside click. Menu popovers position via `popClassName` (`composer-pop`, `ftb-pop`, `tl-layer-menu`, ...).

## CSS placement

- Editor chrome (panel tabs, Create chat, floating toolbar, timeline): `styles/editor.css`. UI kit: `styles/ui.css`. Composer: `styles/composer.css`. Home (incl. zero state) + app legacy: `styles.css`. Delete dead CSS when retiring a component.
- File inputs are hidden `<input type="file">` + a styled dropzone div; snapshot `FileList` synchronously (it's live and emptied by `input.value = ""`).

## Store & interaction

- Every EDL mutation goes through `updateEdl(mutate)` — it's one undo step and schedules the debounced save. Batch multi-asset operations into ONE `updateEdl` call.
- Create-tab turns go through the store (`submitCreate`, `applyCritiqueFixes`) so runs survive tab switches/unmounts; the log persists to `session.json` via `session:save` and helpers live in `lib/session.ts` (pure, tested).
- Editor-wide shortcuts live in `App.tsx` (Cmd+Z, T, Cmd+\, Space) — never inside a component that unmounts (e.g. Timeline in focus mode). Always guard: skip when typing in INPUT/TEXTAREA/SELECT/contentEditable.
- Long text/media lists: cap visible rows and scroll within (`clip-list-capped` pattern).
